============================================================
ATTENTION TOURNAMENT ANALYSIS: Paley T_7 attention
============================================================
Token count (tournament size): n = 7
Score sequence: [np.int64(3), np.int64(3), np.int64(3), np.int64(3), np.int64(3), np.int64(3), np.int64(3)]
Regular: True
H(T) = 189

Cartan decomposition of attention matrix:
  ||A_anti|| / ||A|| = 0.5000  (tournament/'active' fraction)
  ||A_sym||  / ||A|| = 0.5000  (similarity/'dark' fraction)
  Dimensions: active=21, dark=27, null=1

Odd cycle analysis:
  Total directed odd cycles: 80
    3-cycles: 14
    5-cycles: 42
    7-cycles: 24
  Conflict graph too large (80 vertices) for independence polynomial

Transitivity index: 0.6000 (21/35 transitive triples)

